cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite both the manuscript and this software release."
type: software
title: "CMLTRPCNN — physics-constrained neural network for ABO3 microwave-dielectric permittivity prediction"
abstract: "Physics-constrained neural network that decomposes ABO3 microwave-dielectric permittivity into Clausius-Mossotti, Lyddane-Sachs-Teller, octahedral-tilt and confidence-gated residual contributions. Includes the trained 5-seed ensemble, training pipeline, conformal calibration, applicability-domain analysis, virtual screening, and physics-constrained genetic-algorithm inverse design."
version: "1.2.0"
date-released: "2026-07-02"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/anbu-nems/CMLTRPCNN"
url: "https://github.com/anbu-nems/CMLTRPCNN"
authors:
  - name: "PCNN Authors"
preferred-citation:
  type: generic
  title: "A physics-constrained neural network for mechanism-resolved interpretability and band-targeted inverse design of ABO3 dielectric ceramics - application to 5G/6G resonator hardware"
  notes: "Manuscript submitted to InfoMat (Wiley) on 2026-06-18. Journal information and DOI will be added on acceptance. This v1.1.1 software release accompanies that submission; the code, dataset, and scientific results are unchanged from v1.1.0 (the v1.1.1 tag exists only to record the submission date)."
